  "shape": {
    "$description": "Centralized shape system (added 2026-11-18, Rudro requirement). ONE default shape — box, radius 0, used most of the time. Roles reference the radius tokens (NEXUS REDESIGN_PLAN.md §2.3 values); no screen hardcodes radii or padding. Changing a role here updates everywhere. Implemented as AppShapes in lib/widgets/app_theme.dart.",
